    "promotionDetails": {
      "detailEn": "<p><strong>“Savour the Tastes of Home in Hundred Ways” Stamp Rewards Programme - Part 2 </strong></p>\n\n<p>Event Promotion Period: 17 August to 31 October 2026</p>\n\n<p>Stamp & Gift Redemption Period: 17 August to 31 October 2026</p>\n\n<p>Promotion Venues^: 24 designated shopping centres or fresh markets</p>\n\n<p>Stamp & Gift Redemption Venue: Customer service counters of the designated promotion venues</p>\n\n<p>Stamp Redemption Time: 11:00 – 20:00 or service hours of individual redemption venues△</p>\n\n<p><strong>Each receipt can be redeemed for a maximum of 20 stamps.</strong></p>\n\n<p>Stamp cards issued under Phase 1 of “Savour the Tastes of Home in Hundred Ways” are also applicable. A maximum of two stamp cards can be used for each redemption.</p>\n\n<p>During the Gift Redemption Period, customers who accumulate the designated number of stamps are entitled to redeem one corresponding gift at the gift redemption venue during the redemption hours. A total of 3,990 gifts are available on a first-come, first-served basis, while stocks last.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Number of Stamps Required to Redeem the Corresponding Gift</strong></p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Gift</strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Number of Stamps Required        </strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Total Quantity</strong></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>“Savour the Tastes of Home in Hundred Ways”</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Ceramic Plates Set</p